# Committed: reproducible from README.md alone, plus the crates.io-derived
# artifacts. The latter are small (~2MB) and cost a 1.8GB download to rebuild,
# so a clone is useful immediately; crates-provenance.json records which dump
# snapshot they came from, which is how you tell whether they are stale.
